  message: "DONE in PR #2203 (dev c9295d38c6, commit 40be3f52b4), as the owner ruled on 2026-11-15: rank_score, its ceiling and the schema are unchanged; entries of equal rank_score order by detection confidence, then language weight, then effective out-degree, then path / start line / name / symbol id; when the entrypoint cap cuts through a group of equal score its slots are dealt round-robin across source files, at each of its three cuts (kind quota, cap, fill). REPRO RE-RUN BY ME ON BOTH ARMS (the fixture of this item's 11-01 review: 80 Flask routes in app.py plus an Express scanner/server.js with POST /scan and GET /health; `hypergumbo survey`; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr3/repro/out_base.txt and out_fixed.txt): before, the 48 kept http_route entries are all from app.py and no Express route is kept; on the PR's code 47 are from app.py and `HTTP POST /scan` is kept (rank 1.0, confidence 0.95), and the sketch lists it under Entry Points. MEASURED on 23 repositories before / after (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr3/mapaj/TABLE.txt): the entry count is unchanged on every one; the kept set changes on 8 (forgejo 111 swapped, distinct files 311 -> 417; vite 27; pydantic-core 12; lazygit 3; alertmanager, prometheus, nats-server, thc 1 each); on thc the Express POST /scan is now kept. The entry list of the two fixtures is identical under PYTHONHASHSEED 0 to 4. No stable id moved (express 3,612 of 3,612, httpx 1,549 of 1,549 at the same position with the same id). CORRECTION TO THIS ITEM'S TEXT: GET /health does not tie at 1.0; it scores 0.9896 (the description's own thc figure, 0.989), so it is outside the tied group and is STILL DROPPED on thc and on the fixture. NOT ASSERTED / LEFT OPEN, filed as WI-fupap-titip-dipar-dajij-hifih-rinus-sujip-punim: a program's main (confidence literal 0.80) now sorts after routes (0.90 / 0.95) among ties (a main left the top 3 of the list on 6 of the 23 repositories, e.g. prometheus cmd/prometheus/main.go position 0 -> 48; `slice --entry auto` picks the same symbol before and after on alertmanager, prometheus, kserve); routes just under 1.0; the sketch's per-group budget cut is not round-robin; the route-label dedup's choice among equal-score duplicates. The proposal's other half, avoiding boost saturation for routes, was ruled out by the owner (rank_score stays)."  # 38ad
